1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:03,510
December 17, 1903.

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:06,910
Orville wired home: success, four flights.

3
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:10,151
The longest, 57 seconds.

4
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:14,246
Next day, the paper printed the same number.

5
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:21,020
The first flight lasted 12 seconds.

6
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:23,628
One hundred and twenty feet.

7
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:28,380
The fourth flight: 852 feet,

8
00:00:28,420 --> 00:00:30,962
in 59 seconds.

9
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,918
The telegram was two seconds short.
